{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789228450433,"sessionID":"ses_f69b53dfaffe6jVh3DZezfRAcf","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_4d667d0cb7eb4316b7b1c560","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.datasets import load_digits\n\n\ndef sigmoid(z):\n    out = np.empty_like(z)\n    pos = z >= 0\n    out[pos] = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-z[pos]))\n    out[~pos] = np.exp(z[~pos]) / (1.0 + np.exp(z[~pos]))\n    return out\n\n\ndef softplus(z):\n    return np.maximum(z, 0.0) + np.log1p(np.exp(-np.abs(z)))\n\n\ndef loss(w, Xb, y):\n    z = Xb @ w\n    return np.mean(softplus(z) - y * z)\n\n\ndef grad(w, Xb, y):\n    p = sigmoid(Xb @ w)\n    return Xb.T @ (p - y) / Xb.shape[0]\n\n\ndef finite_diff_grad(w, Xb, y, h):\n    g = np.zeros_like(w)\n    for j in range(w.size):\n        wp = w.copy()\n        wm = w.copy()\n        wp[j] += h\n        wm[j] -= h\n        g[j] = (loss(wp, Xb, y) - loss(wm, Xb, y)) / (2.0 * h)\n    return g\n\n\ndigits = load_digits()\nmask = (digits.target == 3) | (digits.target == 8)\nX = digits.data[mask] / 16.0\ny = (digits.target[mask] == 8).astype(float)\nXb = np.column_stack([X, np.ones(X.shape[0])])\n\nprint(\"X shape  =\", X.shape)\nprint(\"y shape  =\", y.shape)\nprint(\"Xb shape =\", Xb.shape)\nprint(\"d =\", Xb.shape[1], \"(64 features + 1 intercept)\")\n\nw0 = np.random.RandomState(0).normal(size=Xb.shape[1]) * 0.01\ng_analytic = grad(w0, Xb, y)\n\nprint()\nprint(\"central-difference gradient check over ALL 65 dims,\")\nprint(f\"checkpoint w0 = Normal(0, 0.01) * 0.01, seed 0\")\nprint()\nprint(f\"{'h':>8}  {'max |fd - analytic|':>20}  {'max |rel err|':>14}\")\nprint(\"-\" * 52)\nfor p in range(2, 10):\n    h = 10.0 ** (-p)\n    g_fd = finite_diff_grad(w0, Xb, y, h)\n    abs_err = np.abs(g_fd - g_analytic)\n    rel_err = abs_err / np.maximum(np.abs(g_analytic), 1e-12)\n    print(f\"{h:8.1e}  {abs_err.max():20.3e}  {rel_err.max():14.3e}\")","filePath":"C:\\Users\\User\\Documents\\ai-math-refresh-20260912\\agent-lab3-notes-auto\\lab3_logistic.py"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"C:\\Users\\User\\Documents\\ai-math-refresh-20260912\\agent-lab3-notes-auto\\lab3_logistic.py","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"Users\\User\\Documents\\ai-math-refresh-20260912\\agent-lab3-notes-auto\\lab3_logistic.py","time":{"start":1789228450420,"end":1789228450431}},"id":"prt_096535c70001vlKz7JHxAtSTrR","sessionID":"ses_f69b53dfaffe6jVh3DZezfRAcf","messageID":"msg_096527a7f0019DsZ6yCAuveTN3"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1789228450468,"sessionID":"ses_f69b53dfaffe6jVh3DZezfRAcf","part":{"id":"prt_0965342390010VWwzYni9EiXqr","messageID":"msg_096527a7f0019DsZ6yCAuveTN3","sessionID":"ses_f69b53dfaffe6jVh3DZezfRAcf","type":"text","text":"好的，這輪完全照新範圍做：**不動 `logistic.py`**，另建 `lab3_logistic.py`，只含資料讀取、`loss(w)`、`grad(w)` 與有限差分梯度檢查。先推導（不寫程式）。\n\n---\n\n## 一、從負對數概似推到 $L(w)=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum\\bigl[\\log(1+e^{z})-yz\\bigr]$\n\n設 $X_b$ 為設計矩陣（64 個像素欄末補一欄 1 當截距），$w\\in\\mathbb{R}^{65}$，線性預測值 $z_i=w^{\\top}x_{b,i}$，標籤 $y_i\\in\\{0,1\\}$，模型 $P(y_i=1\\mid x_i)=\\sigma(z_i)$。\n\n單樣本 Bernoulli 概似 $P(y_i\\mid x_i)=\\sigma(z_i)^{y_i}\\bigl(1-\\sigma(z_i)\\bigr)^{1-y_i}$，取負對數並加總：\n$$\\mathrm{NLL}=-\\sum_i\\Bigl[y_i\\log\\sigma(z_i)+(1-y_i)\\log\\bigl(1-\\sigma(z_i)\\bigr)\\Bigr].$$\n\n代入 $\\log\\sigma(z)=-\\log(1+e^{-z})$ 與 $\\log(1-\\sigma(z))=-z-\\log(1+e^{-z})$，整理得\n$$\\mathrm{NLL}=\\sum_i\\Bigl[\\log(1+e^{-z_i})+z_i-y_iz_i\\Bigr]\n=\\sum_i\\Bigl[\\log(1+e^{z_i})-y_iz_i\\Bigr],$$\n最後一步用 $\\log(1+e^{-z})+z=\\log(e^z)+\\log(1+e^{-z})=\\log(1+e^z)$。除以 $n$ 即為平均損失：\n$$\\boxed{\\,L(w)=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\Bigl[\\log\\bigl(1+e^{z_i}\\bigr)-y_iz_i\\Bigr],\\qquad z_i=w^{\\top}x_{b,i}\\,}$$\n\n## 二、從 $L(w)$ 推到 $\\nabla L=\\frac{1}{n}X_b^{\\top}\\bigl(\\sigma(X_b w)-y\\bigr)$\n\n逐項微分：$\\frac{d}{dz}\\log(1+e^z)=\\sigma(z)$，$\\frac{d}{dz}(yz)=y$，且 $\\frac{\\partial z_i}{\\partial w}=x_{b,i}$，故\n$$\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\bigl(\\sigma(z_i)-y_i\\bigr)\\,x_{b,i}\n=\\frac{1}{n}X_b^{\\top}\\Bigl(\\sigma(X_b w)-y\\Bigr).\\qquad\\boxed{\\,}$$\n\n---\n\n推導完成，現在建立 `lab3_logistic.py`。","time":{"start":1789228433977,"end":1789228450455}}}
